Clint Hays went undefeated in the Swiss rounds and beat Jim Boyd in the final for the $1,000 prize. Myers finished the Swiss 2nd at 12 points (+129), then lost a match to [[Brian Rippetoe]]; they "switched places", Rippetoe taking 2nd and Myers 3rd ($150). [[Steven Lewis]] finished 5th in the Swiss.<ref name="tr-myers-atl" /> Myers posted his Dark list as "the exact list" he played; it went 4–0.<ref name="dt-18196" />

